{"id":64,"date":"2025-06-24T14:23:49","date_gmt":"2025-06-24T12:23:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/about"},"modified":"2025-10-30T12:33:11","modified_gmt":"2025-10-30T11:33:11","slug":"om-oss","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/om-oss","title":{"rendered":"Om oss"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"64\" class=\"elementor elementor-64\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-502e7cd0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"502e7cd0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-751d1e7a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"751d1e7a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-462bed2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"462bed2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Trygghet i hver kobling<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87311ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"87311ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"593\">Stavanger Elektro leverer trygge, moderne og energieffektive l\u00f8sninger, tilpasset alt fra sm\u00e5 boliger til st\u00f8rre n\u00e6ringsbygg. Vi kombinerer solid fagkunnskap med personlig oppf\u00f8lging, og er stolte av \u00e5 v\u00e6re en lokal akt\u00f8r du kan stole p\u00e5.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c491951 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1c491951\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4486ae70 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4486ae70\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3e57961b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3e57961b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fbd8f59 elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial\" data-id=\"fbd8f59\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"testimonial.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-content\">Kvalitet. <BR>\nTrygghet.<BR>\nPunktlighet. <BR>\nFremtidsrettet.<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-meta-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-details\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-job\">V\u00e5re verdier<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12362f25 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"12362f25\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b832eae e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3b832eae\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5fb925c2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5fb925c2\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66714b5e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"66714b5e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">En ny akt\u00f8r med solid bakgrunn<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27ae8a3d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"27ae8a3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"424\">Stavanger Elektro ble etablert med et klart m\u00e5l: \u00e5 tilby trygge, moderne og p\u00e5litelige elektrotjenester, med mennesket i fokus. Selv om selskapet er nytt, er kompetansen bygget p\u00e5 mange \u00e5rs <i>erfaring<\/i> fra bransjen, og et sterkt engasjement for kvalitet og kundetilfredshet.<\/p><p data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"705\">Vi s\u00e5 et behov for en elektroinstallat\u00f8r som kombinerer faglig <i>trygghet<\/i> med personlig service og smarte l\u00f8sninger. Med lokal tilknytning og brennende interesse for faget, \u00f8nsker vi \u00e5 gj\u00f8re hverdagen enklere og <i>tryggere<\/i>, for b\u00e5de privatpersoner og bedrifter i Stavanger-regionen.<\/p><p data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"848\">V\u00e5r visjon er \u00e5 v\u00e6re et foretrukket valg n\u00e5r det gjelder el-installasjoner, ved \u00e5 levere arbeid som gir <i>komfort, sikkerhet<\/i> og <i>verdi<\/i> over tid.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Trygghet i hver kobling Stavanger Elektro leverer trygge, moderne og energieffektive l\u00f8sninger, tilpasset alt fra sm\u00e5 boliger til st\u00f8rre n\u00e6ringsbygg. Vi kombinerer solid fagkunnskap med personlig oppf\u00f8lging, og er stolte av \u00e5 v\u00e6re en lokal akt\u00f8r du kan stole p\u00e5. Kvalitet. Trygghet. Punktlighet. Fremtidsrettet. V\u00e5re verdier En ny akt\u00f8r med solid bakgrunn Stavanger Elektro ble [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-64","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/64","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=64"}],"version-history":[{"count":77,"href":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/64\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1071,"href":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/64\/revisions\/1071"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.stavanger-elektro.no\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=64"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}